EDAT reader: writable cache. edat_resolve wrote "<file>.dec" beside the source, which is read-only in a game install
and in the sandbox. With $PS3_EDAT_CACHE or edat_set_cache_dir(dir) the plaintext goes to <dir>/<content id>/<name>.dec,
reused while a "<name>.dec.key" sidecar (header digest + dev_hash + size) matches the source; written via ".part" +
rename. Without a cache directory the old beside-the-source behaviour stays. Applies after 5001. Test:
port/vfs/test_vfs_overlay.sh (step 1). Upstream candidate.

